  m_Text: '- A number (0-9) appears at the top. It stands for an IUPAC counting prefix.

    -
    Bunnies pop out of the holes with speech bubbles showing different prefixes.

    -
    Tap the ONE bunny whose bubble matches the number shown.

    - Catch the right
    bunny 20 times to finish. A wrong pick costs a life - you have 3!

    - Grab
    teddy bears for power-ups: extra life, slow time, reveal, or freeze.'
